 Because we have a lot of those in Eagle Mountain and Saratoga Springs, where we're saying, man, I wish we would have done this differently.

2396
02:24:27,100 --> 02:24:29,280
 Or why in the world did we do this?

2397
02:24:29,360 --> 02:24:35,680
 This has such a negative impact on traffic or safety for the kids going to and from.

2398
