 I think that's the best way to do things between the school district and the cities so that we're trying to, right, before we've done those things and we can help you with some of those decisions and show, you know,

2404
02:25:05,700 --> 02:25:13,700
 this is the future plan of how this road is going to be so that we don't put schools on a road that's going to be a major collector arterial road.

2405
