 And I did try when we first had this on our agenda to reach out to Saratoga Springs where I represent.

2440
02:27:45,100 --> 02:27:52,300
 And I do think that as we move forward, we have an issue of we have built a lot of schools in the wrong locations.

2441
02:27:52,840 --> 02:28:06,880
 And we need to solve that going forward because all it creates is frustration and animosity between city officials, parents, students, staff, community.

2442
02:28:07,140 --> 02:28:11,340
 And I think we can work to do that better.

2443
02:28:12,340 --> 02:28:13,960
 I can't reach out on this one.

2444
02:28:14,040 --> 02:28:16,900
 I will reach out even better on the next one.

2445
02:28:17,060 --> 02:28:18,260
 I have a learning curve.

2446
02:28:18,320 --> 02:28:22,080
 This is a question for both of you with the creation of new school district.

2447
02:28:22,080 --> 02:28:30,340
 Does the board have the ability to create kind of their own guidelines, legislative processes, et cetera?

2448
02:28:30,740 --> 02:28:36,740
 Or is that dictated by the state and you basically, it's just kind of a template that you adopt and away you go?

2449
02:28:36,960 --> 02:28:44,500
 We create policies and we have flexibility and we could create a policy surrounding land purchase of a school.

2450
02:28:44,920 --> 02:28:47,880
 I would be very interested in being part of that conversation.

2451
02:28:48,260 --> 02:28:49,940
 Yeah, we could create a policy.

2452
02:28:49,940 --> 02:29:00,480
 We could sit down and come up with something that would be very good about requiring the entities to work together for the best safe solution, not just land acquisition.

2453
02:29:00,660 --> 02:29:12,600
 Right, because sometimes you guys buy the site that's cheaper, which I get, but it's not cheaper overall for the taxpayers because lights have to be put in, safe routes to school, and we've got to do that, right?

2454
02:29:12,600 --> 02:29:17,880
 And so when we can lay all of that out and compare costs, I think it's helpful.

2455
02:29:17,880 --> 02:29:24,600
 Again, when we created that policy or procedure, it would be binding on the district if there was disagreements.

2456
02:29:24,940 --> 02:29:27,600
 I can't write policy or procedure that...

2457
02:29:28,220 --> 02:29:48,660
 No, no, the reality is that that gives the Saratoga Springs City Council, Eagle Mountain City Council the opportunity to sit down and say, okay, let's put in our code some guiding principles for when developments are done that we're going to help identify by MBA or whatever, that this is a probable location, bring the school district in.

2458
02:29:48,660 --> 02:29:49,660
 How do you feel?

2459
02:29:49,660 --> 02:29:50,660
 How do you feel about this?

2460
02:29:50,660 --> 02:30:03,100
 Things that we can do to mitigate the cost, because we understand that part of it, but also safe routes, putting into place that's the best service area for that area that will be a long-term service area, not, you know, that we tend to have at the very end.

2461
02:30:03,100 --> 02:30:04,100
 Yeah.

2462
02:30:04,100 --> 02:30:13,100
 I don't want to be in the position of prior priors where more skills just magically appear in cities.

2463
02:30:13,100 --> 02:30:22,100
 I want to be a partner and I want to work because the infrastructure and the transportation in keeping students safe is key.

2464
02:30:22,100 --> 02:30:32,100
 I'm wondering what state code, whether it's an MBA or something like that, if we can mandate to a developer this school site and their MBA?

2465
02:30:32,100 --> 02:30:33,100
 I don't know if it can.

2466
02:30:33,100 --> 02:30:35,100
 An MBA is a private contract.

2467
02:30:35,100 --> 02:30:37,100
 You can put whatever you want in the MBA.

2468
02:30:37,100 --> 02:30:50,100
 It's whatever both parties will agree.

2469
02:30:50,100 --> 02:30:52,100
 We can't bind the school district to anything in an MBA.

2470
02:30:52,100 --> 02:30:53,100
 No, no.

2471
02:30:53,100 --> 02:30:54,100
 We're talking about a contractor.

2472
02:30:54,100 --> 02:31:02,100
 Yeah, but if you're saying, oh, we're going to bind the developer to this is going to be a school site in the MBA, I mean, we have that.

2473
02:31:02,100 --> 02:31:03,100
 That could happen.

2474
02:31:03,100 --> 02:31:08,100
 In the harmony MBA, for example, we have like, these are school sites.

2475
02:31:08,100 --> 02:31:09,100
 Guess what?

2476
02:31:09,100 --> 02:31:10,100
 School district doesn't want them.

2477
02:31:10,100 --> 02:31:12,100
 Again, I think that coordination.

2478
02:31:12,100 --> 02:31:13,100
 That's kind of what, yeah.

2479
02:31:13,100 --> 02:31:15,100
 So can we bind the contractor?

2480
02:31:15,100 --> 02:31:16,100
 Sure.

2481
02:31:16,100 --> 02:31:26,100
 But the Marcus's point, that may not be amenable to the school, but that's why we need to have them part of that conversation up front and say, does this meet your qualifications for topography?

2482
02:31:26,100 --> 02:31:28,100
 We know that's an issue, right?

2483
02:31:28,100 --> 02:31:31,100
 That's something that they can, they can weigh in on those things.

2484
02:31:31,100 --> 02:31:37,100
 But yeah, I think having the conversations that we have not been having helps to have a better outcome.

2485
02:31:37,100 --> 02:31:43,100
 We were meeting with the board and talking about those kinds of issues.

2486
02:31:43,100 --> 02:31:53,100
 And then we got the school on the freeway and we, you know, so we were having those conversations and they said they wanted to be a part of it, but it just didn't.

2487
02:31:53,100 --> 02:31:54,100
 I just don't feel like it's being communicated to the board.

2488
02:31:54,100 --> 02:31:56,100
 I just don't feel like it's being communicated to the board.

2489
02:31:56,100 --> 02:31:59,100
 They can create a policy that kind of gives the guidance.

2490
02:31:59,100 --> 02:32:01,100
 Agreed, because then it's not a pinky problem.

2491
02:32:01,100 --> 02:32:02,100
 That's right.

2492
02:32:02,100 --> 02:32:11,100
 And again, trying to negotiate that and it's not a problem specific to your community or Saratoga Springs community.

2493
02:32:11,100 --> 02:32:21,100
 I sat in a meeting with Lehigh community with frustration, so again, I think moving forward, my intent is to be a better partner.

2494
02:32:21,100 --> 02:32:26,100
 I made baby steps in being a better partner with my city on this one.

2495
02:32:26,100 --> 02:32:28,100
 Did I hit it out of the park?

2496
02:32:28,100 --> 02:32:29,100
 Absolutely not.

